WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,340 --> 00:00:02,340
I suddenly remembered

2
00:00:02,340 --> 00:00:04,340
Doesn't seem that busy

3
00:00:04,340 --> 00:00:05,340
Tomorrow morning is fine

4
00:00:05,340 --> 00:00:08,980
Tomorrow I won’t go home once in half a year

5
00:00:08,980 --> 00:00:12,320
I was the one who forced you to come back.

6
00:00:12,320 --> 00:00:13,320
Stay at least three days

7
00:00:13,320 --> 00:00:16,730
OK for three days

8
00:00:19,240 --> 00:00:20,240
Weren't you very capable just now?

9
00:00:20,240 --> 00:00:36,370
Are you still pinching me?

10
00:00:36,370 --> 00:00:38,370
It seems that Qin Yadaer gave it to me.

11
00:00:38,370 --> 00:00:41,670
The bottom of the car is broken
